## 2. اشتباهات legacy — checklist منفی

قبل از هر PR فاز ۱، این موارد باید **false** باشند:

| # | Anti-pattern | تشخیص | اقدام |
|---|--------------|--------|--------|
| A1 | Denali import در platform-core | `rg -i denali packages/platform-core` | revert |
| A2 | Import از `packages/workspaces/*` | depcruise | revert |
| A3 | Import از `legacy/` | depcruise | revert |
| A4 | React/DOM در platform-core | `rg "react" packages/platform-core` | جدا → ui-primitives فاز ۲ |
| A5 | `if (workspaceType === 'denali')` | code review | policy در plugin |
| A6 | کپی `DenaliFieldRenderer` | path/name grep | widget در workspace فاز ۶ |
| A7 | dual state (form + canonical) | — | ممنوع تا فاز ۳ UI |
| A8 | engine test با denali-domain fixture | import path | از `starter` fixture استفاده |
| A9 | PR بزرگ 1.2–1.5 یکجا | diff > ~800 lines | split |
| A10 | merge بدون CI سبز | GitHub red | block |

### 2.1 Anti-pattern ↔ `dependency-cruiser` (repo truth)

| ID | Anti-pattern | Enforced by | Rule name / guard |
|----|--------------|-------------|-------------------|
| A1 | Denali in platform-core | `phase-1-guard` `g3_no_denali_tokens` | `rg -i denali` (excl. `*.spec.ts`) |
| A2 | Import `packages/workspaces/*` | `guard:architecture` | `platform-core-no-workspaces` |
| A3 | Import `legacy/` | `guard:architecture` | `no-legacy-imports` |
| A4 | React/DOM in platform-core | `phase-1-guard` `g4_no_react_imports` | `rg react` on `packages/platform-core` |
| A5 | `if (workspaceType === 'denali')` | code review | (no depcruise rule — policy in plugin) |
| A6 | کپی `DenaliFieldRenderer` | code review + A1 | — |
| A7 | dual state (form + canonical) | architecture | immutable canonical ingress؛ scope LRU per §3.3 |
| A8 | denali-domain test fixture | code review + A1 | `test/fixtures/starter.fixture.ts` only |
| A9 | oversized PR | process | — |
| A10 | merge without green CI | `phase-1-gate.yml` | `pnpm run phase-1:gate` |

**Additional platform-core rules (not in §2 table but binding):**

| Rule | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| `platform-core-only-sdk` | May depend only on `workspace-sdk`, `config`, self |
| `platform-core-no-apps` | Must not import `apps/*` |

§8 «ممنوع» table aligns with A2 (`workspaces/*`), A3 (`legacy` via depcruise), and `platform-core-no-apps` (apps).

