## 3. تعریف platform-core

### 3.1 مسئولیت‌ها

| ماژول | مسئولیت | نیست |
|--------|---------|------|
| **FieldRegistryEngine** | lookup field by id/path؛ list by step | validation business Denali |
| **RuleEngine** | resolve cell؛ merge overrides | API persist |
| **render-plan.steps** | active steps؛ visibility | routing Next.js |
| **buildRenderPlan** | headless plan: kind + path + props hints | JSX |
| **PlatformWizardEngine** | facade orchestrating above | HTTP |

### 3.2 وابستگی مجاز

```text
@app-tour/platform-core (فاز ۱)
  → @app-tour/workspace-sdk ONLY
  → @app-tour/config (dev/tsconfig)

@app-tour/platform-core (فاز ۲+)
  → + @app-tour/design-tokens (types/CSS var names — نه import workspace)
```

> **Import law:** [`MIGRATION-MAP.md` §2](MIGRATION-MAP.md#قانون-import-ci-blocking) — `platform-core` فقط `workspace-sdk`؛ **↓ downstream-only** — هرگز `design-tokens` / `ui-primitives` (visual layer در فاز ۲+).

### 3.3 مدل محاسباتی

| قانون | معنی |
|-------|------|
| **No document mutation** | `CanonicalDocument` / `WorkspacePlugin` ingress clones are **deep-frozen** — resolution does not write caller-owned data |
| **Instance scope cache (not “pure”)** | `RuleEngine` LRU (`scopeCacheByTenant`) and `RuleEngineScope` memo (`resolvedCellId`, `effectiveByFieldId`) **mutate the engine instance** — safe when every call passes `tenantId` + dimensions; **do not** treat `RuleEngine` as a global singleton across tenants without `RuleContext` |
| **Pure resolution (per call)** | Given the same frozen inputs + `RuleContext`, `createScope(context).resolveCellId()` / `buildRenderPlan` outputs are deterministic — **no** canonical/plugin mutation |
| **Facade session state** | `create()` clones plugin immediately; `runtime` (field/rule engines) loads on first `tryInit` — **one engine per tenant session**; `tryFromPlugin` eager |
| **Immutable outputs** | `readonly` arrays/objects in API surface |
| **No I/O** | DB، HTTP، filesystem ممنوع در platform-core |

