### 3.5 Engine mapping — FieldRegistry · Rule · Step

Source of truth: `packages/platform-core/src/engine/` (see repo tree §3.4).

#### FieldRegistryEngine

**File:** [`field-registry.engine.ts`](../../packages/platform-core/src/engine/field-registry.engine.ts)  
**Tests:** [`field-registry.engine.spec.ts`](../../packages/platform-core/test/unit/engine/field-registry.engine.spec.ts) (**7** cases)

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  FR_IN[WorkspaceFieldRegistry from plugin]
  FR_BUILD[FieldRegistryEngine constructor]
  FR_MAPS[byId byCanonicalPath byStepId]
  FR_API[get listByStep listAll assertKnownFieldIds]
  FR_IN --> FR_BUILD --> FR_MAPS --> FR_API
```

| Responsibility | API |
|----------------|-----|
| Index fields at bootstrap | `constructor(registry)` — rejects duplicate ids |
| Lookup | `getById(fieldId)` · `listByStep` · `listAll` |
| Step grouping | `listByStep(stepId)` |
| Rule bootstrap | `assertKnownFieldIds` for override validation |

#### RuleEngine

**File:** [`rule.engine.ts`](../../packages/platform-core/src/engine/rule.engine.ts) · [`rule-cell-index.ts`](../../packages/platform-core/src/engine/rule-cell-index.ts)  
**Tests:** [`rule.engine.spec.ts`](../../packages/platform-core/src/engine/rule.engine.spec.ts) (**25**) · [`rule-cell-index.spec.ts`](../../packages/platform-core/src/engine/rule-cell-index.spec.ts) (**4**) · [`rule-engine-concurrency.spec.ts`](../../packages/platform-core/test/rule-engine-concurrency.spec.ts) (**4**)

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  RS[WorkspaceRuleSet]
  FR[FieldRegistryEngine]
  RE_ctor[RuleEngine constructor]
  IDX[RuleCellIndex]
  SCOPE[createScope RuleEngineScope]
  CELL[resolveCellId]
  EFF[resolveEffectiveField]
  RS --> RE_ctor
  FR --> RE_ctor
  RE_ctor --> IDX
  RE_ctor --> SCOPE
  SCOPE --> CELL
  SCOPE --> EFF
```

| Responsibility | API |
|----------------|-----|
| Validate default cell + overrides | constructor — `INVALID_RULE_SET`, `UNKNOWN_FIELD_ID` |
| Tenant-scoped resolution | `createScope(context)` → cached `RuleEngineScope` |
| Pick rule cell | `createScope(context).resolveCellId()` |
| Per-field effective state | `scope.resolveEffectiveField(fieldId)` |

