## 4.3. زیرفاز 1.3 — RuleEngine

### Rule context (public)

```typescript
export interface RuleContext {
  readonly tenantId: string;
  readonly dimensions: Readonly<Record<string, string>>;
}
```

`forceCellId` exists only on internal `RuleContextResolution` and is allowed when `RuleEngineScopePolicy.allowForceCellId` is injected via `createPlatformWizardEngineForTests` — **not** `NODE_ENV`, **not** on public `RuleContext`.

### API

```typescript
export class RuleEngine {
  private constructor(
    ruleSet: WorkspaceRuleSet,
    fieldEngine: FieldRegistryEngine,
    scopePolicy?: RuleEngineScopePolicy,
  );

  static tryCreate(
    ruleSet: WorkspaceRuleSet,
    fieldEngine: FieldRegistryEngine,
    scopePolicy?: RuleEngineScopePolicy,
  ): PlatformResult<RuleEngine>;
  static create(...): RuleEngine;

  createScope(context: RuleContext | RuleContextResolution): RuleEngineScope;
}

// RuleEngineScope — per-scope memo + resolution
scope.resolveCellId(): string;
scope.resolveEffectiveField(fieldId: string): EffectiveFieldState;
scope.listEffectiveFields(): readonly EffectiveFieldState[];
```

export interface EffectiveFieldState {
  readonly fieldId: string;
  readonly entry: WorkspaceFieldRegistryEntry;
  readonly hidden: boolean;
  readonly required: boolean;
}
```

### الگوریتم resolve cell (`rule-resolution.ts`)

1. اگر `forceCellId` (test policy only) → cell باید در `ruleSet.cells` باشد؛ وگرنه `INVALID_RULE_SET`
2. else: cellهایی که **همه** `(key, value)` در `cell.dimensions` با `context.dimensions` برابرند
3. اگر چند match با **همان** specificity/priority → `AMBIGUOUS_RULE_RESOLUTION` (**بدون** fallback lexicographic)
4. در غیر این صورت: بیشترین تعداد کلیدهای matched → `priority` بالاتر → یک winner
5. bootstrap (plugin ingress / `validateWorkspaceRuleSet`): بیش از یک cell با `dimensions: {}` بدون `priority` متمایز → `INVALID_RULE_SET`
6. bootstrap: `defaultCellId` باید در `cells` باشد (`RuleEngine.tryCreate` همان را چک می‌کند)
7. runtime: اگر هیچ cellی match نکند → `RULE_CONTEXT_UNMATCHED` (نه fallback خودکار به `defaultCellId`؛ catch-all با `dimensions: {}` match می‌شود)

> **نکته:** `context.dimensions` می‌تواند کلید اضافه داشته باشد؛ فقط کلیدهای cell match می‌شوند. کلیدهای `matrixDimensions` که در context نیستند → برای آن cell match نمی‌شوند.

### merge overrides

```
base = registry entry (required)
override = cell.fieldOverrides for fieldId
effective.required = override.required ?? base.required
effective.hidden = override.hidden ?? false
```

### تست‌ها (حداقل 8)

1. default cell when no dimension match
2. exact dimension match
3. override required true/false
4. hidden suppresses field in listEffectiveFields
5. unknown override fieldId → throw at construction یا resolve
6. multiple cells — deterministic pick
7. empty dimensions
8. integration with starter plugin ruleSet

### Exit criteria 1.3

- [x] RuleEngine + tests ≥ 8 (**31** — `rule.engine.spec` + `rule-cell-index.spec` + `rule.engine.force-cell.spec`)
- [x] no Denali dimension names in production tests — `variant: "default"` in fixtures

