## 5. API surface — `PlatformWizardEngine`

### 5.1 مدل خطا (یک پلیسی — سه شکل داده)

| لایه | نوع | مصرف |
|------|-----|------|
| Bootstrap / ingress | `PlatformResult<T>` | `tryFromPlugin`, `tryInit`, engine `tryCreate` |
| Field validation | `ValidationResult` | `validateCanonical` — `violations[]` |
| Facade convenience | `PlatformCoreError` throw | فقط `init()` / `buildRenderPlan()` — **نه** export `unwrapPlatformResult` |

Ingress و bootstrap **Result-first** هستند؛ throw فقط در لبه facade برای ergonomics اپ (فاز ۳). جزئیات در [`platform-result.ts`](../../packages/platform-core/src/errors/platform-result.ts).

### 5.2 مثال استفاده (فاز ۳ API)

```typescript
import { createStarterWorkspacePlugin } from "@app-tour/workspace-sdk/plugin";
import { PlatformWizardEngine } from "@app-tour/platform-core";

const loaded = PlatformWizardEngine.tryFromPlugin(createStarterWorkspacePlugin(preset));
if (!loaded.ok) {
  throw loaded.error; // or handle PlatformResult in app layer
}
const engine = loaded.value;
const context = {
  tenantId: "tenant-a", // required — missing → INVALID_RULE_CONTEXT
  dimensions: { variant: "default" },
};
const plan = engine.buildRenderPlan(context);
// → web renderer consumes plan (Phase 3 WorkspaceWizardHost)
```

**Lazy alternative:** `PlatformWizardEngine.create(plugin)` clones plugin at construction (headless ingress), then `engine.init()` or first `buildRenderPlan` builds engines — init failure **not** sticky.

### 5.3 Isolation (tenant + engine reuse)

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| **One engine per tenant session** | Reuse `PlatformWizardEngine` only when every call passes a distinct `tenantId` in `RuleContext` — LRU scope cache is keyed by tenant + dimensions |
| **No cross-tenant sharing** | Do not call `buildRenderPlan` / `validateCanonical` without `tenantId`; missing/blank → `INVALID_RULE_CONTEXT` |
| **Concurrent API** | Safe to share one initialized engine across parallel requests **iff** each request supplies correct `tenantId` (see `rule-engine-concurrency.spec.ts`) |
| **Plugin alias window** | `create(plugin)` immediately deep-clones via `parseWorkspacePluginFromStorage({ includeTheme: false })` — invalid shape throws `PlatformCoreError`; `tryFromPlugin` maps that to `PlatformResult` |

**قانون مصرف‌کننده (apps / `apps/api` / `apps/web`):** فقط `PlatformWizardEngine` از `@app-tour/platform-core` — **هرگز** `FieldRegistryEngine` / `RuleEngine` مستقیم.

**تست‌های پکیج:** ساخت مستقیم engine در `test/**/*.spec.ts` مجاز است (unit + adversarial) — این **سیاست داخلی** است و توسط depcruise/contract محدود می‌شود، نه همان قانون اپ.

