## 9. §14.4 Forensic Truth vs Marketing

> **Mandatory per [MIGRATION-MAP §14.4](MIGRATION-MAP.md#۱۴۴-self-referencing-audit-mandatory-phase-docs).** Green checklists below do not imply every aspirational bullet is enforced in CI.

| Claim (marketing / DoD) | Reality (repo 2026-06) | Status |
|---------------------------|------------------------|--------|
| «Headless platform — no theme in engine» | `buildRuntime` uses `includeTheme: false`; theme SDK codes map to `PLUGIN_INVALID_SHAPE` at boundary | **Enforced** — `phase-1.contract` + `adversarial-plugin-ingress` |
| «Fail-fast `fromPlugin`» | **`fromPlugin` removed** — use `create` + `init` or `tryFromPlugin` | **Enforced** — production `src/` has no `fromPlugin` |
| Test count ≥ 132 (gate floor) | `phase-1-guard` `g2` count floor — **does not** alone prove behavioral closure | **Enforced** count + `g11` / `g12` behavioral specs |
| `plugin.validation` hooks at runtime | Hooks on plugin object may still run when workspace calls them — platform-core does not invoke hooks in Phase 1 | **Deferred** — Phase 3+ API |
| Public `RuleEngine` / internal engines | Hidden from `index.ts`; only `PlatformWizardEngine` facade exported | **Enforced** |
| `unwrapPlatformResult` on barrel | **Not exported** — apps use `tryFromPlugin` + `PlatformResult` | **Enforced** — `phase-1.contract` |
| Sticky `initError` on failed bootstrap | **Removed** — `tryInit` re-attempts; `tryFromPlugin` eager | **Enforced** — `cold-start.contract` |
| Single facade `package.json` export | `"."` only; `"./*": null` documented §4.6.2 | **Enforced** |
| Adversarial theme-inclusive init | `test/adversarial-plugin-ingress.spec.ts` | **Enforced** |
| `forceCellId` production-safe | Denied unless test factory injects scope policy — not on public `RuleContext` | **Enforced** |
| Full §14.4 in this doc before 2026-06-02 | Section added in UB-013 remediation | **Closed** |
| `IngressSanitizationError` → platform codes | **1:1** via `ingress-sanitization-map.ts` → dedicated `SANITIZE_*` `PlatformCoreErrorCode` values (not collapsed to `CANONICAL_INVALID_DATA`) | **Enforced** — REM-002 / UB-002 |
| Facade test share (package policy) | `g13_facade_test_ratio` — ≥ **60%** facade-path `it()` in closure specs (excl. `test/unit/**`) | **Enforced** — REM-003 · [`gate-thresholds.mjs`](../scripts/guards/gate-thresholds.mjs) |
| `import-purity-probe.mjs` | Dist-only import graph probe; test-only `Module._resolveFilename` patch | **PASS** (IB-009 / FC-019) — not app surface |

**Open / deferred (Architect sign-off):** workspace-specific UI in `RenderPlan` beyond opt-in `includeWorkspaceStepUiHints`; Phase 2 theme tokens in platform error vocabulary.

